    <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:100pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">15821 Ventura Blvd., Suite 145</p>
    <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:100pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">Encino, CA 91436</p>
    <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p>
    <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 73pt;text-align:justify;">If to Executive, to the address listed in the Company&#8217;s payroll records from time to time.</p>
    <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p>
    <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;">(k) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Cooperation</u>. Executive shall provide Executive&#8217;s reasonable cooperation in connection with any investigation, action or proceeding (or any appeal from any action or proceeding) which relates to events occurring during Executive&#8217;s employment hereunder, provided that, following termination of Executive&#8217;s employment, the Company shall pay all reaspenses incurred by Executive in providing such cooperation. This provision shall survive any termination of this Agreement.</p>
    <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p>
